                  <provenance><orgName role="fmo" key="mlgbOrg_465">Rievaulx, Yorkshire. Cistercian
                        abbey of St Mary the Virgin. </orgName><p>Identifiable as the last page of
                        item u and items v, w of no. 18 in the Savile of Banke catalogue and
                        therefore part of the same manuscript as Oxford, Corpus Christi College 155,
                        and Cotton Vitellius D.ix.</p><p>Vespasian fol. 181 follows immediately
                        after Corpus fol. 267 as the signatures show. They run 3 i Corpus fol. 266;
                        3 ii Corpus fol. 268; 3 iii Corpus fol. 267; 3 iiii Vespasian fol. 181; 3
                        (v--viii), 7 i--(viii), 9 i--(viii), Vespasian fols.
